{"file_id":"LANG_MYOUTER_STAFF_COMMENT.OLANG","resource_class":"STAGEDAT_OLANG","part":7,"range":"300-349","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":300,"cn_text":"“听说训练时可以随便打实弹，是真的吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":301,"cn_text":"“刚才闻到黑豆饭的香味了。会作为餐食供应吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"GALLO_PINTO_LOCALIZED_AS_黑豆饭; TERMINOLOGY_REVIEW"},{"unique_index":302,"cn_text":"“原来你就是那位Boss。很荣幸见到你。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":55,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":303,"cn_text":"“口粮里有红茶和司康饼，对吧？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":304,"cn_text":"“我母亲住院了……危险也没关系，请尽量把我派去收入高的战场。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":305,"cn_text":"“你很幸运，因为我要加入你的部队。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"AUX_TODAY_ADDITION_REJECTED; JPN_JOIN_UNIT_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":306,"cn_text":"“我的实力可是有保证的。\n不管什么任务都交给我吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":307,"cn_text":"“别看我这样，我可是拿过全国举重比赛第三名的。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":308,"cn_text":"“你知道吗？世界一流刺客里有65%是女性。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":309,"cn_text":"“今天的天空也很蓝啊……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":310,"cn_text":"“我主修量子力学。现在也还在私下继续研究。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":311,"cn_text":"“你有一双好眼睛啊，Boss。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":40,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":312,"cn_text":"“……只要是为了你，我连命都可以不要！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":313,"cn_text":"“没有西边东边之分。哪一边需要我，我就站在哪一边。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":314,"cn_text":"“我的祖母曾是战斗机飞行员。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"JPN_GRANDMOTHER_PRESERVED; AUX_MOTHER_SUBSTITUTION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":315,"cn_text":"“这里有优秀的军医吧。\n因一点擦伤丧命都很常见，\n所以绝对需要医术高明的医生。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":"JPN_MINOR_WOUND_DEATH_RISK_PRESERVED; AUX_INFECTION_EXPLANATION_NOT_FORCED"},{"unique_index":316,"cn_text":"“下次请务必在道场和我切磋！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":317,"cn_text":"“我以前在厨房工作过。\n不管是枪还是菜刀，都交给我吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":318,"cn_text":"“这里没几个像样的士兵啊。\n没办法，我就来加入你们吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":319,"cn_text":"“我不会让你失望的，我保证。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":320,"cn_text":"“闻到海潮的气味了……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"JPN_TIDE_SMELL_PRESERVED; AUX_OCEAN_BREEZE_PARAPHRASE_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":321,"cn_text":"“先说清楚，我来这里是为了赚弟弟的学费。\n别跟我搞拙劣的套近乎。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"JPN_NO_FRATERNIZING_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED; AUX_BATTLEFIELD_ROMANCE_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":322,"cn_text":"“工资要是拖欠，我可会闹起来的。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":323,"cn_text":"“好困啊……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":324,"cn_text":"“副武器选手枪还是冲锋枪……\n你会选哪一个？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":325,"cn_text":"“听说在这里，不管男的女的都会一视同仁地任用。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":326,"cn_text":"“我要好好看看你会怎么指挥。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":327,"cn_text":"“只要一日三餐都有着落，我就满足了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"JPN_THREE_MEALS_ARE_ENOUGH_PRESERVED; AUX_GOOD_TO_GO_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":328,"cn_text":"“我已经舍弃故乡了……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"JPN_ABANDONED_HOMETOWN_PRESERVED; AUX_NEVER_LOOKED_BACK_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":329,"cn_text":"“什么命令都下吧。我会完成给你看。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":330,"cn_text":"(不要)“……”（杉田先生（声优）一句话评论暂定）","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"SOURCE_不要_PLACEHOLDER_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":331,"cn_text":"“她曾是传奇英雄，为什么会倒向敌人，\n又为什么非得由她最爱的弟子——你亲手暗杀？\n我想确认的不是被创造出来的虚构……\n而是Boss的真相……以及Boss最后的意志。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":227,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE; JPN_THE_BOSS_TRUTH_AND_LAST_WILL_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":332,"cn_text":"“我们只是抛弃了国家而已。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":333,"cn_text":"“……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":334,"cn_text":"“我的名字是‘La Paz（和平）’。\n我会守护和平到底。我正是为此而活着。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE; LA_PAZ_PEACE_MEANING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":335,"cn_text":"(不要)“……”（大塚先生（声优）一句话评论暂定）","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"SOURCE_不要_PLACEHOLDER_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":336,"cn_text":"“我们不是雇佣兵，也不是外籍军团。\n‘MSF（无国界军队）’是一种新的商业模式。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE; MSF_IDENTITY_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":337,"cn_text":"“我的身体有70%是由电影构成的。\n剩下30%要拿来做什么，就由你决定。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE"},{"unique_index":338,"cn_text":"“我父亲参与过曼哈顿计划。\n他赌上一生的研究孕育出的，是名为‘威慑’的虚幻和平体系。\n以及……无法行走的我。\n所以我只能直面核武器。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":195,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE; JPN_DETERRENCE_AND_DISABILITY_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":339,"cn_text":"“我叫Vladimir Zadornov。\nVladimir的意思是‘统治和平’。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE; VLADIMIR_NAME_MEANING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":340,"cn_text":"“要是发现UMA就告诉我。\n就是幸存的恐龙、稀奇的怪物之类的。\n有一天，我想成为猎人。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE; UMA_MONSTER_HUNTER_TERMS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":341,"cn_text":"“我在想，要不放弃研究鸟类，自己去飞吧。”\n\n“想听听凤尾绿咬鹃的叫声吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE; QUETZAL_LOCALIZED_AS_凤尾绿咬鹃"},{"unique_index":342,"cn_text":"“要成为首领（Cacique），需要特殊的能力。\n需要能够团结同志（Compa）的伟大力量。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":"STORY_CHARACTER_LINE; CACIQUE_COMPA_PARENTHETICALS_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":343,"cn_text":"曾作为NASA研究员被视为前途无量，后来转入DARPA（美国国防高级研究计划局），开始埋头于人工智能研究。\n\n她厌恶人类，很少在人前露面。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":185,"review_flag":"CHARACTER_BIO; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":344,"cn_text":"热爱和平的哥斯达黎加少女。\n\n她是Gálvez的学生，在筹备设立中的哥斯达黎加联合国和平大学学习和平宪法。\n\n她曾被开始在哥斯达黎加各地活动的神秘武装势力俘虏。\n\n她与Gálvez一同委托“无国界军队”排除这股武装势力。\n\nPaz这个名字在西班牙语中意为“和平”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":352,"review_flag":"CHARACTER_BIO; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":345,"cn_text":"法国鸟类学家。\n\n为了调查中美洲鸟类分布而来到哥斯达黎加，却误入神秘遗迹，并被不明人士抓获。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":134,"review_flag":"CHARACTER_BIO; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":346,"cn_text":"作为桑地诺民族解放阵线（FSLN）司令官的女儿，她在尼加拉瓜从事以革命为目标的游击活动。\n\n为躲避镇压逃到哥斯达黎加后，父亲被神秘武装势力杀害，她也肩负起作为新任领袖率领组织的使命。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":261,"review_flag":"CHARACTER_BIO; JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":347,"cn_text":"Strangelove","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":11,"review_flag":"CHARACTER_NAME_FIXED_LATIN"},{"unique_index":348,"cn_text":"Snake","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":5,"review_flag":"CHARACTER_NAME_FIXED_LATIN"},{"unique_index":349,"cn_text":"Paz Ortega Andrade","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":"CHARACTER_NAME_FIXED_LATIN"}]}